From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anthoine Bourgeois <anthoine.bourgeois@vates.tech>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 11:54:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] tapdisk-vbd: fix image lookup when there is no image

This can be reproduce by a close on a loaded VDI, then a cancel.

Signed-off-by: Anthoine Bourgeois <anthoine.bourgeois@vates.tech>
---
 drivers/tapdisk-vbd.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/tapdisk-vbd.c b/drivers/tapdisk-vbd.c
index 7b5171cd..b66825ae 100644
--- a/drivers/tapdisk-vbd.c
+++ b/drivers/tapdisk-vbd.c
@@ -170,13 +170,13 @@ tapdisk_vbd_first_image(td_vbd_t *vbd)
 static inline td_image_t *
 tapdisk_vbd_first_non_log_image(td_vbd_t *vbd)
 {
-	td_image_t *image = NULL, *tmp;
+	td_image_t *image, *tmp;
 
 	tapdisk_vbd_for_each_image(vbd, image, tmp)
 		if (image->type != DISK_TYPE_LOG)
 			return image;
 
-	return image;
+	return NULL;
 }
 
 static inline td_image_t *
